  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Port of Cartagena Power Supply Alternatives, through K &amp; M Advisors LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Port of Cartagena Power Supply Alternatives Feasibility Study will support Terminal de Contenedores de Cartagena S.A. (Contecar), the operator of the Port of Cartagena&apos;s largest container facility, in exploring reliable and sustainable power supply solutions to meet the needs of the port&apos;s expanding operations. The study will explore the feasibility of expanding transmission system connections as well as the possibility of on-site energy generation.</narrative>
  </description>
